From dae19eda3e0ca54dc8198ef83e8ba1a6c187441e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Plecki <dylan@andyl.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 07:14:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Serialize bounded releases and retain reentry debt

Share the allocation try-lock with release, refuse busy release without touching node metadata, and retain sticky cleanup debt. Validate alignment, complete header and payload spans, and allocation kind before recording a logical release.

Exercise real signal-handler release at the held allocation lock, duplicate release and malformed alignment, prefix, endpoint and size controls. The full one-lane build, bounded controls and eleven ordinary regression tests pass under the unchanged two-GiB per-process ceiling. The repeated ABI check retains its sole documented private-prefix locale-directory size difference.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Plecki <dylan@andyl.com>
---
 nptl/README.bounded-pthread     | 11 +++-
 nptl/pthread-bounded-internal.h | 47 ++++++++++++-----
 nptl/tst-pthread-bounded.c      | 91 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 134 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/nptl/README.bounded-pthread b/nptl/README.bounded-pthread
